1
00:00:00,646 --> 00:00:02,116
(Leonard:)Howard, just come in here.

2
00:00:02,115 --> 00:00:03,885
(Penny:)Yeah, come on, Raj.

3
00:00:03,883 --> 00:00:06,053
(Raj:)Wait, did Amy make
her spinach dip?

4
00:00:06,052 --> 00:00:07,052
(Sheldon:)She did.

5
00:00:07,053 --> 00:00:09,123
And I'm gonna eat it all!

6
00:00:09,122 --> 00:00:11,292
(door slams)

7
00:00:17,231 --> 00:00:18,861
(Howard:)So what the hell happened?

8
00:00:18,866 --> 00:00:21,166
(Leonard:)Oh, I just ran out of patience
with Sheldon's nonsense.

9
00:00:21,169 --> 00:00:23,869
(Howard:)Tell me about it.
I've had it with Raj, too.

10
00:00:23,871 --> 00:00:27,011
(Amy:)You know, like women, men have
a monthly hormone cycle.

11
00:00:27,008 --> 00:00:29,138
(Amy:)Dips in testosterone
can cause irritability.

12
00:00:29,143 --> 00:00:30,643
(Howard:)Interesting.

13
00:00:30,645 --> 00:00:35,415
(Howard:)Maybe my male cycle synced up
with Raj's actual period.

14
00:00:37,018 --> 00:00:40,558
(Leonard:)If Sheldon's testosterone
dipped, he'd become a butterfly.

15
00:00:40,555 --> 00:00:41,325
(knocking on door)

16
00:00:41,322 --> 00:00:43,592
(Sheldon:)Oh.

17
00:00:43,591 --> 00:00:46,461
(Leonard:)Maybe someone's here
to apologize.

18
00:00:47,295 --> 00:00:48,995
(Stuart:)Hey, Leonard.

19
00:00:50,498 --> 00:00:51,998
(Leonard:)Stuart.

20
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,070
(Raj:)Uh...

21
00:00:55,803 --> 00:00:58,573
(Stuart:)Is this not a dress-up party?

22
00:00:58,573 --> 00:01:03,023
(Sheldon:)No.

